// Test-only (mods/jokers-luck/tests/merge-contexts.mewtest): every player cat gets JokersLuck TWICE at battle start,
// both through StatusOnBattleStart, i.e. two apply_status calls whose ctx is the passive component (the
// Component-shaped context). Merged, each cat carries ONE JokersLuck with 1 + 2 = 3 stacks. Never ship or play with it.
PlayerCat {
	passives {
		StatusOnBattleStart {
			JokersLuck 1
			JokersLuck 2
		}
	}
}
